      <details>
        <summary>What wipes are best for Pilates equipment?</summary>
        <div class="wpx-faq__a">Look for plant-based materials, equipment-safe wipes that remove sweat and residue quickly and are gentle on vinyl and upholstered surfaces like reformer carriages and chairs. For busy studios, a high-count bulk refill roll such as the Wipex 700ct keeps cost per wipe low and stations stocked between classes.</div>
