      <details>
        <summary>What cleaning supplies does a Pilates studio need?</summary>
        <div class="wpx-faq__a">A high-traffic studio needs equipment cleaning wipes at every station, a dispenser or wipe station where cleaning happens, and backup bulk inventory. Most studios standardize on a bulk refill roll plus a floor dispenser, with smaller packs for secondary stations.</div>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How often should Pilates equipment be cleaned between classes?</summary>
        <div class="wpx-faq__a">Reformers, chairs, handles, straps, and shared props should be wiped down after every class as part of your between-class reset. A stocked wipe station at each cleaning point keeps that routine fast and consistent even during back-to-back sessions.</div>
