        <summary>Are bulk wipes better for busy Pilates studios?</summary>
        <div class="wpx-faq__a">Yes. Bulk refill rolls lower your cost per wipe and cut restocking frequency, which means fewer empty stations and less staff downtime during peak fall hours. The Wipex 700ct Bulk Refill Roll is built for exactly this level of studio volume.</div>
