<script type="application/ld+json"> { "@context":"https://schema.org", "@type":"FAQPage", "mainEntity":[ {"@type":"Question","name":"What wipes are best for Pilates equipment?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Look for plant-based materials, equipment-safe wipes that remove sweat and residue quickly and are gentle on vinyl and upholstered surfaces like reformer carriages and chairs. For busy studios, a high-count bulk refill roll such as the Wipex 700ct keeps cost per wipe low and stations stocked between classes."}}, {"@type":"Question","name":"What cleaning supplies does a Pilates studio need?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A high-traffic studio needs equipment cleaning wipes at every station, a dispenser or wipe station where cleaning happens, and backup bulk inventory. Most studios standardize on a bulk refill roll plus a floor dispenser, with smaller packs for secondary stations."}}, {"@type":"Question","name":"How often should Pilates equipment be cleaned between classes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reformers, chairs, handles, straps, and shared props should be wiped down after every class as part of your between-class reset. A stocked wipe station at each cleaning point keeps that routine fast and consistent even during back-to-back sessions."}}, {"@type":"Question","name":"Are bulk wipes better for busy Pilates studios?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Bulk refill rolls lower your cost per wipe and cut restocking frequency, which means fewer empty stations and less staff downtime during peak fall hours. The Wipex 700ct Bulk Refill Roll is built for exactly this level of studio volume."}}, {"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best wipe dispenser setup for a Pilates studio?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For high-traffic, member-facing studios, pair a 700ct bulk refill with the Wipex Premium Studio White Floor Dispenser. It creates a centralized, easy-access station with a premium appearance and scales cleanly as you add stations or locations."}} ] } </script>
